{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PS5模擬器發展速度嚇人。就在一個月前，它還只能卡在遊戲的主界面上，而現在最新的進展則是：已能在KyTyPS5模擬器上以40-60幀運行了PS5版《給他愛5》。網友預測，過不了多久，我們就能在PC上玩《GTA6》了……</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>對此，有網友認為這是一個好消息，至少會給R星壓力，讓他們能更快地推出PC版。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》還會遠嗎？PS5模擬器已成功遊玩《給他愛5》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788699312_570422.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》還會遠嗎？PS5模擬器已成功遊玩《給他愛5》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788699312_790739.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》還會遠嗎？PS5模擬器已成功遊玩《給他愛5》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788699312_527599.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》還會遠嗎？PS5模擬器已成功遊玩《給他愛5》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788699312_248509.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》還會遠嗎？PS5模擬器已成功遊玩《給他愛5》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788699312_570422.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》還會遠嗎？PS5模擬器已成功遊玩《給他愛5》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788699312_790739.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》還會遠嗎？PS5模擬器已成功遊玩《給他愛5》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788699312_527599.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T13:58:01.150800+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":7,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}